            "value": "Allen, Richard, Donnay, Manuel, Rao, Ajith, Wilson, Fletcher, Beckman, Bjorn, Dakermandji, Jan and Lithammer, Johan and Waszkiewicz, Michel. (2007). Pangea Interface. Stanford Digital Repository. Available at: http://purl.stanford.edu/rf642dj5262",
